'''Ryoga Hibiki (Pig)''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 598
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Ryoga Hibiki (Pig)
|name2 = Ryoga Hibiki
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ryoga Hibiki''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
With an effective 244,800 health against Black and Metal enemies and a high movement speed of 17, Ryoga Hibiki seems like he would be a rather effective tanker against his niche. Unfortunately, there are quite a few flaws in his abilities that prevent him from being a very good Uber. His tanking niche against Black and Metal enemies clashes with said enemy types usually having insane DPS, with enemies such as [[Shadow Boxer K]] and [[Metal One Horn]] still managing to easily shred through his health despite the resistance. Additionally, he suffers the classic [[High Lord Babel (Legend Rare Cat)|High Lord Babel]] problem of being a ranged tanker, meaning he'll just stand behind all of your frontline attackers instead of protecting them properly.

He also has a number of issues to be of any use as a ranged attacker/crowd-controller. For one, his DPS of 4,673 is very mediocre for a unit of his cost, and his Critical Hit chance is pitifully low, preventing him from effectively killing Metal enemies without insane luck. As a crowd-controller, knockback just isn't a good effect against Dark enemies, as they tend to have high knockback counts already, and its effectiveness against Metal enemies is hampered by his slow attack rate. Overall, Ryoga Hibiki is just a very unfortunate unit trying to combine ranged attacking and tanking, but simply failing at both.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Crowd-Controller}}

